  "description": "Status handoffs from Main and to Rename, with reserve selection, display pages and character return. Cycling through both formation bounds preserves Main's viewport, and cancelling a rename returns the original name to Status.",
  "registration": "Rust inventory-fixture adds one Rename Gem to both copies of the eight-member Strategy fixture; skit 833 was already viewed in that fixture. Native update 64 is source VI 0, with source-observed field/UI origins registered once. Captures and inputs follow the source effect clock, omitting its disc waits: 16 VIs before Status first appears at VI 199, four before Main returns at VI 297, and twelve before Status reopens at VI 375. presentation_advances preserves those independently observed UI ticks, without advancing scripts or random streams. Status starts at fade 206/portrait 224; each departing page retains its final transparent pose. Missing video presentations are omitted based on timestamps. Each frame independently checks UI/menu state, party and field effects. Native character Right corresponds to source R; previous/next-page use C-stick vertical. The final resource release stalls four more VIs before Main first appears at VI 657; its four UI ticks are registered at native update 685. Main state checks include its selected character and viewport. Cycling through both formation bounds must preserve that viewport until the inspected character is returned to Main. Rename cancellation must preserve all saved names and the gem. The final Status departure has no recorded video presentation at VI 651; its other observed poses and final transparent frame remain compared.",
